<section class="card small"><h2>Use in SketchUp Pro</h2><p>Open <strong>Window → Ruby Console</strong> and run:</p><pre>load File.expand_path('~/Downloads/cabinet-drafter_generated_TIMESTAMP.rb')</pre><p>Each Ruby download gets a unique timestamped filename so SketchUp cannot accidentally reload an older copy. After downloading, the page shows the exact load command. The script replaces the prior Generated Cabinet Lineup, models drawer boxes, mixed open cubbies/divider panels, real birch ladder toe-kick bases with cherry skins, and cherry fronts, optionally adds cabinet text labels and independently selectable per-drawer box-height and face-height labels, and saves a native SKP to your Desktop.</p></section>
