      <tr><td><strong>Drawer / mixed</strong></td><td>Drawers, or drawers combined with fixed open cubbies.</td><td>Pure drawer cabinet: 3/4 birch carcass. If any open cubby is present, the carcass becomes 3/4 cherry so the visible interior is cherry.</td></tr>
